---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
	<h1>About</h1>

	<p>
		I'm an ML engineer at DataNimbus in Plano, TX. Most of my work is taking messy,
		real-world data and turning it into models that actually run in production, which
		usually means the modeling is the easy half and everything around it is the
		interesting half.
	</p>

	<p>
		Recent work: demand forecasting for home services companies, churn and lifetime
		value models, an agentic financial intelligence platform, and migrating a legacy
		Java ML pipeline to Python on Databricks for a marketing data company. I've also
		been building an internal platform for ML experimentation and model management on
		Databricks Apps, which I wrote about in <a href="/blog/pushing-the-limits-of-databricks-apps/">Pushing the Limits of Databricks Apps</a>.
	</p>

	<p>
		Before DataNimbus I was at Persistent Systems and Capiot Software, working mostly on
		health data (ECG signal processing) and address and entity matching at scale. I did
		my MS in Computer Engineering at NYU Tandon.
	</p>

	<h2>Outside of work</h2>
	<p>
		I shoot film. The latest frames end up on <a href="https://instagram.com/upafilm">@upafilm</a>.
	</p>
	<iframe
		class="ig-embed"
		src="https://www.instagram.com/upafilm/embed/"
		title="@upafilm on Instagram"
		loading="lazy"
	></iframe>

	<h2>Right now</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Building an ML experimentation platform on Databricks Apps</li>
		<li>Open to new roles. <a href="/contact/">Say hi</a>.</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>

<style>
	.ig-embed {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
